      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "PS: Basically, the problem occurs in all worlds, but there seem to be some worlds where the problem is noticeable and others where it is not.\n\nDark skies and reflection probes, environments with some lighting may be most noticeable.\n\nHere is the world where I took the screenshot.\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_fc64e08e-6cbc-4fa9-8c72-6e82cf20fadc",
